        "created_at": "2015-06-18T06:09:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm all for putting a woman on American money, but Alexander Hamilton more or less single handedly created the American banking system. Can't we redesign the twenty? Andrew Jackson was kind of a dick.</p>",
